2026-07-27T09:46:22.9075208Z i /tmp/RtmpvlI0il/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:46:22.9075600Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:46:22.9076069Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:46:22.9076824Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:46:22.9077446Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:46:22.9078367Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:46:22.9079337Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
